msgstr "403 - Interdit"

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/403.html:15
#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/404.html:15
msgid "Oops..."
msgstr "Oups..."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/403.html:17
msgid ""
"It seems like the project you are trying to access is not available. It may "
"have been deleted, or maybe it belongs to someone else."
msgstr ""
"Il semblerait que le projet auquel vous essayez d'accéder n'est pas "
"disponible. Il peut avoir été supprimé ou peut-être appartient-il à "
"quelqu'un d'autre."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/403.html:20
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If someone sent you this link, have them send you the 'Share' link at the "
"bottom of their Outfit Suggestion page instead. If that is not the case and "
"this keeps happening, you can contact us <a "
"href=\"%(contact_url)s\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Si quelqu'un vous a envoyé ce lien, demandez lui plutôt de vous envoyer le "
"lien 'de partage' au-dessus de sa page de suggestion d'équipement. Si ce "
"n'est pas le cas et que cela continue à se produire, vous pouvez nous "
"contacter <a href=\"%(contact_url)s\">ici</a>."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/403.html:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Or you can go back to the <a href=\"%(home_url)s\">home</a> page or <a "
"href=\"%(create_project_url)s\">create a project</a> of your own."
msgstr ""
"Ou vous pouvez retourner à la <a href=\"%(home_url)s\">page d'accueil</a> ou"
" <a href=\"%(create_project_url)s\">créer un projet</a> de votre choix."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/404.html:10
msgid "404 - Page Not Found"
msgstr "404 - Page non trouvée"

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/404.html:17
msgid "We could not find the page you are looking for."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas pu trouver la page que vous cherchez."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/404.html:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You can go back to the <a href=\"%(home_url)s\">home</a> page instead, or "
"send us a message <a href=\"%(contact_url)s\">here</a> if this keeps "
"happening."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez revenir à <a href=\"%(home_url)s\">l'acceuil</a> à la place, ou "
"nous envoyer un message <a href=\"%(contact_url)s\">ici</a> si cela continue"
" à se produire."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/500.html:10
msgid "500 - Application Error"
msgstr "500 - Erreur d'application"

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/500.html:19
msgid "The application threw an error. It's probably our fault."
msgstr "L'application a détecté une erreur. C'est probablement notre faute."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/500.html:20
msgid "Please return to the previous page and try again."
msgstr "Merci de retourner à la page précédente et de réessayer."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/500.html:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If that doesn't work, please contact us <a href=\"%(contact_url)s\">here</a>"
" and tell us all about this problem."
msgstr ""
"Si ça ne marche pas, merci de nous contacter <a "
"href=\"%(contact_url)s\">ici</a> pour nous parler de votre problème."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/about.html:6
msgid "About"
msgstr "À propos"

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/about.html:19
msgid ""
"The Dofus Fashionista is a fan site about <a "
"href='http://www.dofus.com'>Dofus</a>. It uses mathematical programming, a "
"branch of <a "
"href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence'>witchcraft</a>, "
"to come up with set suggestions that conform to requirements (e.g. 12 AP, 6 "
"MP with as much Intelligence as possible) the player provides."
msgstr ""
"Dofus Fashionista est un fan-site à propos de <a "
"href='http://www.dofus.com'>Dofus</a>. Ce site utilise des programmes "
"mathématiques, <a "
"href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence'>une intelligence"
" artificielle</a>, pour réussir à déterminer une panoplie qui correspond aux"
" critères demandés (Par exemple : 12 PA, 6 PM, avec un maximum "
"d'intelligence) par le joueur."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/about.html:20
msgid ""
"When a new project is created, the Wizard tries to figure what the character"
" is about by reading the build and class specified. It then creates an "
"initial configuration for the first run."
msgstr ""
"Quand un nouveau projet est créé, l’assistant commence en lisant les "
"caractéristiques et la classe demandées par le joueur. Après cela, il crée "
"une première composition répondant aux critères demandés."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/about.html:21
msgid ""
"The outfit suggestion might not be what you were looking for. You can find, "
"for example, the HP too low despite the good Agility. Tweaking can be done "
"by going back to the wizard and playing with the sliders, or going hardcore "
"and fiddling directly with the value the attributed to each stat."
msgstr ""
