#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/solution.html:30
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you don't like an item, click the forbid ( <img style='position: "
"relative; bottom: -3px; left: -2px;' src=%(delete)s title='Forbid'> ) button"
" under its name and <a href=\"%(run_again_link)s\" class=\"rerun-"
"button\">run again</a>. If, on the contrary, you want to lock in an item for"
" future sets for this char, click the lock (<img style='position: relative; "
"bottom: -1px; left: 0px;' src=%(lock)s title='Lock'>) button. You can also "
"switch any item for another you like best by clicking the switch (<img "
"class='solution-item-button' style='position: relative; bottom: -5px; left: "
"0px;' src=%(switch)s title='Switch'>) button."
msgstr ""
"Si vous n'aimez pas un item, cliquez sur le bouton ( <img style='position: "
"relative; bottom: -3px; left: -2px;' src=%(delete)s title='Interdire'> ) "
"interdire en dessous de son nom et <a href=\"%(run_again_link)s\" "
"class=\"rerun-button\">relancez</a>. Si, au contraire, vous voulez "
"verrouiller un item pour vos futurs équipements pour ce personnage, cliquez "
"sur le bouton (<img style='position: relative; bottom: -1px; left: 0px;' "
"src=%(lock)s title='Verrouiller'>) verrouillage. Vous pouvez aussi échanger "
"n'importe quel item pour celui que vous préférez en cliquant sur le bouton "
"modifier (<img class='solution-item-button' style='position: relative; "
"bottom: -5px; left: 0px;' src=%(switch)s title='Changer'>)."

#: fashionsite/chardata/templates/chardata/solution.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This set was generated from scratch. Click the add (<img style='position: relative; bottom: -4px; left: 1px;' src=%(add)s title='Add'>) buttons to choose items and build a set for you."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Ce stuff a été conçu à partir de rien. Cliquez sur le bouton ajouter (<img style='position: relative; bottom: -4px; left: 1px;' src=%(add)s title='Ajouter'>) pour choisir des équipements et créer votre propre stuff."

