msgid ""
"Plain-language guides to building characters in Dofus: how to make your "
"first set, how the optimizer works, what every stat is worth, and the "
"differences between Dofus 3, Beta, Dofus 2, Retro and Touch."
msgstr ""
"Des guides clairs pour monter ses persos sur Dofus : faire son premier "
"stuff, comprendre l'optimiseur, savoir ce que vaut chaque carac, et les "
"différences entre Dofus 3, Bêta, Dofus 2, Retro et Touch."

msgid ""
"Short, no-nonsense guides for getting the most out of the Fashionista — and "
"out of your Dofus characters. No fluff, just the stuff that actually changes"
" your build."
msgstr ""
"Des guides courts et sans blabla pour tirer le max de la Fashionista — et de"
" tes persos Dofus. Pas de remplissage, que du concret qui change vraiment "
"ton build."

msgid "Done reading?"
